  "query": "-- veoveo: all tenants (a server's workers address the Tasks they run by ID, whichever tenant owns them)\nSELECT input.request_key, input.kind, input.params, input.response, input.created_at,\n    input.responded_at\nFROM tasks.task_input AS input\nJOIN tasks.task AS task ON task.id = input.task_id\nWHERE task.id = $1 AND task.server = $2 AND task.deployment = $4 AND input.request_key = $3\n",
